# Network monitoring output. Contains household activity — which device talked
# to what, when, and how much — so it must never reach this repository, which
# is public. Reports and pcaps both live here.
#
# Ignored by pattern rather than by being outside the tree, so note that a
# `git add -f` would still stage it. Nothing in here is ever worth committing.
